{"publicId":"adf12142-43ff-43d1-b4c1-40d8d0a9d6aa","title":"AriBio ED药物阿尔茨海默病试验样本量过小未达终点","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T22:22:47.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T22:22:47.000Z","digest":"AriBio公司11月17日公布的42人样本量阿尔茨海默病试验显示未达疗效终点。该研究基于此前现实证据（Endpoints News 2026-11-17），即男性Viagra类药物使用者认知衰退风险较低，但当前试验未验证这一关联。主要问题包括样本量过小（42人）且未明确终点定义，导致结果无法推广至全体人群。早先有研究提出ED药物可能通过改善血管健康间接保护大脑，但AriBio试验未观察到显著神经保护效应。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T12:24:07.266Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"#CTAD26: 伟哥类药物在阿尔茨海默病中的新用途研究结果平淡","latestReport":{"id":"k9njzkyo5b6j5n5v2ztohnxoy"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fqK2We8_YuQA","title":"AriBio’s repurposing of ED drug for Alzheimer’s yields tepid","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T22:22:47.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"k9njzkyo5b6j5n5v2ztohnxoy","title":"#CTAD26: 伟哥类药物在阿尔茨海默病中的新用途研究结果平淡","summary":"AriBio 公司将伟哥类药物重新用于阿尔茨海默病的研究结果较为平淡。该研究未见显著疗效，样本量为 42 名受试者。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T22:22:47.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"k9njzkyo5b6j5n5v2ztohnxoy","title":"#CTAD26: 伟哥类药物在阿尔茨海默病中的新用途研究结果平淡","summary":"AriBio 公司将伟哥类药物重新用于阿尔茨海默病的研究结果较为平淡。该研究未见显著疗效，样本量为 42 名受试者。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T22:22:47.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-16T23:00:00.000Z","heat":9.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T00:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T02:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T04:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T05:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T06:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11